  "content": "<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.serveratelier.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.serveratelier.com/assets/themes/atelier/assets/images/banner/sa_budget.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"6664\" height=\"917\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/aw8IZDr.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1126\" height=\"176\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/cV4cJyGXqF\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/745451299713056791?color=7289DA&amp;label=DISCORD&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white&amp;style=for-the-badge\" width=\"202\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fglobox1997.github.io%252fwiki%252fmods%252fVoidZ%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/website?color=7bc466&amp;label=Globox&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;up_message=Wiki&amp;url=https://globox1997.github.io/wiki/mods/VoidZ/\" width=\"132\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/Globox1997/VoidZ/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/issues/Globox1997/VoidZ?color=c4667b&amp;style=for-the-badge\" width=\"142\" height=\"28\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/K0Bn3Mh.png\" width=\"200\" height=\"27\"></p><p>VoidZ 是 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/adventurez\" rel=\"nofollow\">AdventureZ</a> 模組的擴充。它新增了一個維度，你將在其中找到並對抗虛空之影。</p><p>此擴充是為了確保 AdventureZ 能夠更新，而不需依賴 Fabric 維度 API。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/OEWjMG2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"753\" height=\"676\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/WKCuHQL.png\" width=\"80\" height=\"34\"></p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Ol1Tcf8.png\" alt=\"fabric-api\" width=\"125\" height=\"42\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloth-config\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7weZ8uu.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"125\" height=\"42\"></a></p><p>本模組專為 Fabric 開發。</p><p>目前沒有計畫開發 Forge 版本。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>模組包授權：<strong><br></strong></p><p>歡迎在任何模組包中使用本模組</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>錯誤回報：</p><p>請到 GitHub 頁面回報錯誤</p>",
